  "insights": {
    "creative": "Event and model-call offers pull hardest. Bellatox KY's open house image, 'Save the date: fall for the best version of you,' free mini lip flip for the first 10 RSVPs, brought 70 leads on $587.96. Desert Zen's tummy rescue image, first session $149 instead of $399, brought 17 on $164.54. Sanctuaire's model-call video, 15 models, tox at $9.99 a unit, brought 15 on $120.90. We recommend testing the open house format at Starwood or Desert Zen, since the winners share a dated, limited invite.",
    "doing": "The spas booked 203 leads into their CRMs this week at $24.44 each, compared with 242 at $25.47 the week before, on lower spend of $4,960.35 against $6,163.43. Bellatox KY led the group with 100 leads at $11.72 each, lifted by its fall open house.",
    "look_into": "Meta counted 322 leads but only 203 reached the CRMs, so about one in three is not landing. The biggest gaps are Sanctuaire, whose CRM is not connected yet, then Bellatox KY, Essential Health and C Your Beauty. We recommend checking the form connections there first.",
    "next": "Bellatox KY's open house ended Sep 26, so its leads will likely fall next week unless a follow-on offer takes over. We recommend lining up that offer and reviewing the costliest spots: C Your Beauty at $64.84 per lead and the McKinney model call, which spends for few leads."
